1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,179
This tutorial books a meeting in Oasis
Crest Properties:

2
00:00:03,179 --> 00:00:06,358
a Tenant asks for one, the Company Admin
approves

3
00:00:06,358 --> 00:00:09,536
it, and meetings that are over get closed
off.

4
00:00:09,536 --> 00:00:12,009
Signed in as the Tenant Ahmed Hassan,

5
00:00:12,009 --> 00:00:14,128
open Meetings and select New Meeting.

6
00:00:14,128 --> 00:00:16,600
Choose Office Visit, then Next; a Property

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,073
Visit would meet at the unit instead.

8
00:00:19,073 --> 00:00:23,311
The purpose is Tenancy Contract Renewal,
for his contract on unit A-101.

9
00:00:23,311 --> 00:00:26,137
Pick a date, and the wizard lists the

10
00:00:26,137 --> 00:00:28,609
host's free slots; take the first one.

11
00:00:28,609 --> 00:00:31,435
For a renewal the Tenant can propose
terms:

12
00:00:31,435 --> 00:00:34,260
twelve months at 88,000, with a short
note.

13
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,733
The last step lists every choice for

14
00:00:36,733 --> 00:00:38,852
a final check; select Request Meeting.

15
00:00:38,852 --> 00:00:43,090
It is listed as Requested, with the
Company Admin as the host.

16
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:45,563
Now sign in as the Company Admin.

17
00:00:45,563 --> 00:00:48,035
The calendar shows every meeting, and the

18
00:00:48,035 --> 00:00:50,154
new request sits on its day.

19
00:00:50,154 --> 00:00:53,333
Open it to see the date and time, who

20
00:00:53,333 --> 00:00:56,159
asked, the linked contract and the renewal
proposal.

21
00:00:56,159 --> 00:00:56,865
Select Approve.

22
00:00:56,865 --> 00:00:59,338
The meeting is now Approved, with
Complete,

23
00:00:59,338 --> 00:01:01,457
Mark No Show and Cancel available.

24
00:01:01,457 --> 00:01:03,929
Meetings in the past need closing off.

25
00:01:03,929 --> 00:01:07,461
Fatima Al Zaabi's cheque replacement visit
took place on the

26
00:01:07,461 --> 00:01:10,640
twenty-ninth of September, so open it and
select Complete.

27
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:13,112
The penthouse viewing on the thirtieth was

28
00:01:13,112 --> 00:01:15,585
never confirmed and did not take place.

29
00:01:15,585 --> 00:01:18,057
Select Cancel, so it stays on record

30
00:01:18,057 --> 00:01:20,176
as Cancelled instead of being deleted.

31
00:01:20,176 --> 00:01:22,649
Finally, filter the list by status:
Approved

32
00:01:22,649 --> 00:01:24,768
shows the meetings still to come.
